### 1. Skapa en lokal
POST {{host}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Grupprum 3",
  "capacity": 6
}

### 2. Boka 10-12 (ska gå bra)
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "bookedBy": "Anna",
  "startTime": "2026-11-10T10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-11-10T12:00:00"
}

### 3. Boka 11-13 (ska krocka)
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "bookedBy": "Bo",
  "startTime": "2026-11-10T11:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-11-10T13:00:00"
}

### 4. Boka 12-14 (ska gå bra)
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "bookedBy": "Cia",
  "startTime": "2026-11-10T12:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-11-10T14:00:00"
}

### 5. Boka en lokal som inte finns
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 99,
  "bookedBy": "Dan",
  "startTime": "2026-11-11T10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-11-11T12:00:00"
}

### 6. Sluttid före starttid
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "bookedBy": "Eva",
  "startTime": "2026-11-12T12:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-11-12T10:00:00"
}

### 7. Hämta alla bokningar
GET {{host}}/api/bookings

### Hämta en bokning
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/1

### Ta bort en bokning
DELETE {{host}}/api/bookings/1

### Hämta en bokning som inte finns
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/999

### Registrera användare
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "anna",
  "password": "hemligt123"
}

### Samma användarnamn igen (ska ge 409)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "anna",
  "password": "hemligt123"
}

### För kort lösenord (ska ge 400)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bo",
  "password": "kort"
}

### Logga in (ska ge 200 och en token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "anna",
  "password": "hemligt123"
}

### Fel lösenord (ska ge 401)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "anna",
  "password": "fellosenord"
}

### Boka utan token (ska ge 401)
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-11-20T10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-11-20T12:00:00"
}

### Boka med token (ska ge 201, bookedBy ska bli anna)
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "bookedBy": "någon annan",
  "startTime": "2026-11-20T10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-11-20T12:00:00"
}